{
  "_comment": [
    "RWF keybindings.json — full reference with all default bindings.",
    "You only need to include the keys you want to change.",
    "Missing sections or keys fall back to the built-in defaults.",
    "",
    "Key name format:",
    "  Plain character  : \"a\", \"A\", \"1\", \"/\", \"`\"",
    "  Special keys     : \"Enter\", \"Escape\", \"Tab\", \"Space\", \"Backspace\"",
    "  Arrow keys       : \"Up\", \"Down\", \"Left\", \"Right\"",
    "  Navigation keys  : \"Home\", \"End\", \"PageUp\", \"PageDown\"",
    "  Function keys    : \"F1\" – \"F12\"",
    "  Shift + special  : \"Shift+Up\", \"Shift+F3\", \"Shift+Space\"",
    "  Ctrl / Alt       : \"Ctrl+n\", \"Alt+Left\", \"Ctrl+Shift+something\"",
    "  Two-key sequence : \"s+n\" (press s, then n)",
    "",
    "Note: Shift + alpha letter is written as the uppercase letter (e.g. 'A'),",
    "      NOT as 'Shift+a'. Shift is only prefixed for non-alpha keys."
  ],

